  m_text: 'Each Adventure is a self-contained story, a series of daring side quests to tell the tales of your favourite Characters and prove your mettle in unique challenges. Your main game is disconnected from Adventures and isn t affected by Progress you make in them. The Characters, Weapons, PowerUps, and Stages you unlocked are unavailable in Adventures. Boldly take on this new challenge without those trappings, and do what you do best: survive!'
